{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"RCoder AI API","description":"\nRCoder AI 服务 API\n\n基于 ACP (Agent Client Protocol) 的 AI 驱动开发平台，提供完整的 AI 代理集成解决方案。\n\n## 主要功能\n\n- **智能对话**: 支持文本、图像、音频、文档等多媒体内容的 AI 交互\n- **实时通知**: 通过 SSE 协议提供 AI 代理执行进度的实时推送\n- **会话管理**: 完整的会话生命周期管理，支持任务取消\n- **项目隔离**: 每个对话在独立的项目工作空间中进行，确保安全性\n- **Pingora 反向代理**: 基于 Cloudflare Pingora 的高性能反向代理服务\n\n## 技术架构\n\n- **协议**: ACP (Agent Client Protocol) v0.4\n- **代理类型**: 支持 Codex、Claude、Proxy 三种 AI 代理\n- **并发**: 基于 MPMC 架构的高并发处理\n- **实时通信**: Server-Sent Events (SSE) 协议\n- **反向代理**: Cloudflare Pingora 高性能代理服务器\n\n## Pingora 代理功能\n\n- **VNC 代理**: `/computer/vnc/{user_id}/{project_id}/{*path}` - 代理到容器的 noVNC 服务（端口 6080）\n  - 路径示例：`/computer/vnc/user_123/proj_456/vnc.html` - VNC 桌面页面\n  - WebSocket：`/computer/vnc/user_123/proj_456/websockify` - VNC 连接\n- **端口路由**: `/proxy/{port}/{*path}` - 动态路由到任意端口的后端服务\n  - 支持两种方式：直接访问 Pingora 端口 或 通过 API 重定向\n- **负载均衡**: 支持 Round Robin 算法和健康检查\n- **动态发现**: 自动发现和添加后端服务，无需预配置\n- **高性能**: 基于 Rust 异步 I/O 的高性能代理\n\n## 使用流程\n\n1. 调用 `/chat` 接口发送对话请求\n2. 通过 `/agent/progress/{session_id}` 建立 SSE 连接接收实时更新\n3. 可随时通过 `/agent/session/cancel` 取消正在执行的任务\n4. 直接访问 Pingora 代理路径或使用管理接口\n\n## 代理接口示例\n\n- `GET /proxy/status` - 查看代理服务状态\n- `GET /proxy/stats` - 查看代理统计信息\n- `GET /proxy/config` - 查看代理配置信息\n- 直接访问 `http://{host}:{pingora_port}/proxy/{port}/{path}` - 使用 Pingora 代理服务\n","contact":{"name":"RCoder Team","url":"https://github.com/rcoder/rcoder","email":"team@rcoder.com"},"license":{"name":"MIT OR Apache-2.0","url":"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"},"version":"1.0.0"},"servers":[{"url":"http://localhost:8087","description":"本地开发环境"},{"url":"https://api.rcoder.com","description":"生产环境"},{"url":"https://staging-api.rcoder.com","description":"测试环境"}],"paths":{"/agent/progress/{session_id}":{"get":{"tags":["agent"],"summary":"Agent 会话 SSE 通知流","description":"建立到指定 session_id 对应容器的 SSE 连接，实时接收 Agent 执行进度和状态更新。","operationId":"agent_session_notification","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"path","description":"会话ID，用于标识特定的会话连接","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"session456"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"成功建立 SSE 连接，开始接收实时消息","headers":{"Cache-Control":{"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"no-cache"},"Connection":{"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"keep-alive"}},"content":{"text/event-stream":{}}},"404":{"description":"未找到对应的容器","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"CONTAINER_NOT_FOUND","message":"未找到 session_id 对应的活跃容器"},"success":false}}}},"500":{"description":"建立 SSE 连接失败","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"SSE_CONNECTION_ERROR","message":"无法连接到容器的 SSE 端点"},"success":false}}}}}}},"/agent/session/cancel":{"post":{"tags":["agent"],"summary":"转发Agent任务取消请求（gRPC）","description":"将取消请求通过 gRPC 转发到容器内的 agent_runner 服务","operationId":"agent_session_cancel","parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"query","description":"项目ID，用于标识特定的项目","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"test_project"},{"name":"session_id","in":"query","description":"会话ID，用于标识要取消的会话（可选，如果不提供则取消该项目的所有会话）","required":false,"schema":{"type":["string","null"]},"example":"session456"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"成功转发取消请求到容器","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_CancelResponse"},"example":{"data":{"session_id":"session456","success":true},"error":null,"success":true}}}},"400":{"description":"请求参数错误","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"INVALID_PARAMS","message":"Invalid project_id or session_id"},"success":false}}}},"404":{"description":"未找到对应的项目或会话","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"PROJECT_NOT_FOUND","message":"Project or session not found"},"success":false}}}},"500":{"description":"转发取消请求失败","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"CANCEL_FAILED","message":"Failed to forward cancel request to container"},"success":false}}}}}}},"/agent/status/{project_id}":{"get":{"tags":["agent"],"summary":"查询Agent状态","description":"查询指定项目的Agent服务状态信息。如果Agent在容器中存在且运行正常，返回完整的状态信息（包括会话ID、活动时间、模型配置等）；如果Agent不存在，只返回project_id和is_alive=false。","operationId":"agent_status","parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","description":"项目ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"test_project"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"成功获取Agent状态","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_AgentStatusResponse"},"examples":{"Agent不存活":{"value":{"data":{"is_alive":false,"project_id":"test_project"},"error":null,"success":true}},"Agent存活":{"value":{"data":{"created_at":"2024-01-01T10:00:00Z","is_alive":true,"last_activity":"2024-01-01T12:00:00Z","model_provider":{"api_protocol":"OpenAI","default_model":"gpt-4","id":"custom","name":"custom"},"project_id":"test_project","session_id":"session123","status":"Active"},"error":null,"success":true}}}}}},"400":{"description":"请求参数错误","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"INVALID_PARAMS","message":"project_id cannot be empty"},"success":false}}}}}}},"/agent/stop":{"post":{"tags":["agent"],"summary":"销毁Agent容器","description":"直接销毁 project_id 对应的容器，不向容器内的 agent_runner 发送消息。如果容器不存在，也返回成功。","operationId":"agent_stop","parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"query","description":"项目ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"test_project"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"容器不存在但返回成功","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_StopAgentResponse"},"example":{"data":{"message":"容器不存在，无需销毁","project_id":"test_project","session_id":null,"success":true},"error":null,"success":true}}}},"400":{"description":"请求参数错误","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"INVALID_PARAMS","message":"Invalid project_id parameter"},"success":false}}}},"500":{"description":"销毁容器失败","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"DESTROY_FAILED","message":"Failed to destroy container"},"success":false}}}}}}},"/chat":{"post":{"tags":["chat"],"summary":"转发聊天消息到容器化 AI 服务","description":"根据 project_id 动态管理容器（默认使用 ServiceType::RCoder），将原始聊天请求直接转发到容器内的 agent_runner 服务进行处理","operationId":"handle_chat","requestBody":{"description":"聊天请求，包含用户输入的 prompt 和可选的多媒体附件","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ChatRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"成功处理聊天请求","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_ChatResponse"},"example":{"data":{"error":null,"project_id":"test_project","request_id":"req_123456789","session_id":"session456"},"error":null,"success":true}}}},"500":{"description":"服务器内部错误或容器服务异常","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"INTERNAL001","message":"Internal server error"},"success":false}}}}}}},"/computer/agent/stop":{"post":{"tags":["computer"],"summary":"停止 Computer Agent","description":"停止特定 project_id 的 Agent，不销毁容器","operationId":"computer_agent_stop","requestBody":{"description":"停止特定 project_id 的 Agent 请求","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ComputerAgentStopRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"成功停止 Agent","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_ComputerAgentStopResponse"},"example":{"data":{"message":"Agent 已停止","project_id":"proj_456","success":true,"user_id":"user_123"},"error":null,"success":true}}}},"400":{"description":"请求参数错误","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"}}}},"404":{"description":"找不到指定的容器或 Agent","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"}}}},"500":{"description":"服务器内部错误","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"}}}}}}},"/computer/chat":{"post":{"tags":["computer"],"summary":"发送聊天消息到 Computer Agent","description":"根据 user_id 动态管理容器，一个用户对应一个带桌面环境的容器","operationId":"handle_computer_chat","requestBody":{"description":"Computer Agent 聊天请求，包含 user_id 和 prompt","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ComputerChatRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"成功处理聊天请求","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_ChatResponse"},"example":{"data":{"error":null,"project_id":"proj_456","request_id":"req_123456789","session_id":"session789"},"error":null,"success":true}}}},"400":{"description":"请求参数错误（如 user_id 为空）","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"}}}},"500":{"description":"服务器内部错误","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"}}}}}}},"/computer/desktop/{user_id}/{project_id}":{"get":{"tags":["computer"],"summary":"获取 VNC 桌面访问信息","description":"返回 VNC 桌面的访问 URL，推荐使用 Pingora 代理路径访问","operationId":"computer_desktop_vnc","parameters":[{"name":"user_id","in":"path","description":"用户 ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"project_id","in":"path","description":"项目 ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"成功获取 VNC 访问信息","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_DesktopAccessResponse"},"example":{"data":{"container_id":"abc123def456","container_ip":"172.17.0.5","direct_vnc_url":"http://172.17.0.5:6080/vnc.html","direct_websocket_url":"ws://172.17.0.5:6080/websockify","message":"请使用 proxy_vnc_url 访问 VNC 桌面","project_id":"proj_456","proxy_vnc_url":"/computer/vnc/user_123/proj_456/vnc.html","proxy_websocket_url":"/computer/vnc/user_123/proj_456/websockify","success":true,"user_id":"user_123"},"error":null,"success":true}}}},"404":{"description":"找不到用户容器","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_DesktopErrorResponse"}}}},"500":{"description":"服务器内部错误","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"}}}}}}},"/computer/progress/{session_id}":{"get":{"tags":["computer"],"summary":"Computer Agent 会话 SSE 通知流","description":"为 Computer Agent 建立 SSE 连接，实时接收执行进度和状态更新。","operationId":"computer_progress_notification","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"path","description":"会话ID，用于标识特定的会话连接","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"session456"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"成功建立 SSE 连接，开始接收实时消息","headers":{"Cache-Control":{"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"no-cache"},"Connection":{"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"keep-alive"}},"content":{"text/event-stream":{}}},"404":{"description":"未找到对应的容器","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"CONTAINER_NOT_FOUND","message":"未找到 session_id 对应的活跃容器"},"success":false}}}},"500":{"description":"建立 SSE 连接失败","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_String"},"example":{"data":null,"error":{"code":"SSE_CONNECTION_ERROR","message":"无法连接到容器的 SSE 端点"},"success":false}}}}}}},"/computer/vnc/{user_id}/{project_id}/{*path}":{"get":{"tags":["computer"],"summary":"VNC 桌面代理","description":"\n通过 Pingora 代理访问容器的 VNC 桌面服务。\n\n## 访问方式\n\n### VNC 桌面页面\n```\nGET /computer/vnc/{user_id}/{project_id}/vnc.html\n```\n\n### WebSocket 连接\n```\nGET /computer/vnc/{user_id}/{project_id}/websockify\n```\n\n### 其他资源\n```\nGET /computer/vnc/{user_id}/{project_id}/{*path}\n```\n\n## 工作原理\n\n1. 客户端请求到达 RCoder 服务\n2. Axum 路由器匹配到 VNC 代理路径\n3. 请求转发给 Pingora 代理服务\n4. Pingora 根据 user_id 查找容器 IP\n5. Pingora 透明代理请求到容器的 noVNC 服务（端口 6080）\n6. 响应返回给客户端\n\n## 使用示例\n\n```javascript\n// 访问 VNC 桌面页面\nwindow.open('/computer/vnc/user_123/proj_456/vnc.html', '_blank');\n\n// 或在 iframe 中嵌入\n<iframe src=\"/computer/vnc/user_123/proj_456/vnc.html\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\"></iframe>\n```\n","operationId":"computer_vnc_proxy","parameters":[{"name":"user_id","in":"path","description":"用户 ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"project_id","in":"path","description":"项目 ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"path","in":"path","description":"剩余路径，如 vnc.html, websockify 等","required":true,"schema":{"type":["string","null"]}}],"responses":{"101":{"description":"WebSocket 升级响应","content":{"text/plain":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"200":{"description":"成功访问 VNC 资源","content":{"text/plain":{"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html>\\n<head><title>noVNC</title></head>\\n<body>noVNC Client</body>\\n</html>"}}},"404":{"description":"找不到用户容器或资源不存在","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HttpResult_DesktopErrorResponse"},"example":{"code":"PROXY_REDIRECT","data":null,"message":"请使用 Pingora 代理路径访问 VNC 桌面，路径: /computer/vnc/user_123/proj_456/vnc.html","success":false,"tid":null}}}}}}},"/health":{"get":{"tags":["system"],"summary":"健康检查端点","description":"检查服务的健康状态","operationId":"health_check","responses":{"200":{"description":"服务健康状态","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"}}}}}}},"/proxy":{"get":{"tags":["proxy"],"summary":"使用查询参数代理（向后兼容）","description":"通过查询参数指定目标端口和路径，保持向后兼容性","operationId":"proxy_with_query_params","parameters":[{"name":"port","in":"query","description":"端口号（用于向后兼容）","required":false,"schema":{"type":["integer","null"],"format":"int32","minimum":0},"example":3000},{"name":"path","in":"query","description":"路径（可选）","required":false,"schema":{"type":["string","null"]},"example":"/api/users"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"代理成功","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyResponse"}}}},"400":{"description":"缺少端口参数","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyErrorResponse"}}}},"503":{"description":"代理服务未启用","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyErrorResponse"}}}}}}},"/proxy/config":{"get":{"tags":["proxy"],"summary":"获取 Pingora 代理配置","description":"返回当前代理服务的配置信息","operationId":"proxy_config","responses":{"200":{"description":"成功获取配置信息","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyConfig"}}}},"503":{"description":"代理服务未启用","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyErrorResponse"}}}}}}},"/proxy/stats":{"get":{"tags":["proxy"],"summary":"获取 Pingora 代理统计信息","description":"返回代理服务的请求统计和性能指标","operationId":"proxy_stats","responses":{"200":{"description":"成功获取统计信息","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyStats"}}}},"503":{"description":"代理服务未启用","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyErrorResponse"}}}}}}},"/proxy/status":{"get":{"tags":["proxy"],"summary":"获取 Pingora 代理服务状态","description":"返回当前 Pingora 代理服务的运行状态和配置信息","operationId":"proxy_status","responses":{"200":{"description":"成功获取代理状态","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyStatus"}}}},"503":{"description":"代理服务未启用","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyErrorResponse"}}}}}}},"/proxy/{port}":{"get":{"tags":["proxy"],"summary":"重定向到 Pingora 代理（无路径）","description":"\n重定向请求到 Pingora 代理服务，无额外路径。\n\n## 工作原理\n此接口会返回 307 重定向，将请求转发到 Pingora 代理服务的实际端口。\n\n## 实际代理路径\n真正的代理由 Pingora 处理，路径格式为：\n```\nGET /proxy/{port}/\n```\n\n## 使用示例\n```bash\n# 访问此接口\nGET /proxy/3000\n\n# 返回 307 重定向到：\n# http://127.0.0.1:{pingora_port}/proxy/3000/\n\n# Pingora 代理到：\n# 127.0.0.1:3000/\n```\n","operationId":"proxy_to_port","parameters":[{"name":"port","in":"path","description":"目标端口号","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","minimum":0}}],"responses":{"307":{"description":"重定向到 Pingora 代理服务","content":{"text/plain":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"503":{"description":"代理服务未启用","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyErrorResponse"}}}}}}},"/proxy/{port}/{*path}":{"get":{"tags":["proxy"],"summary":"重定向到 Pingora 代理（含路径）","description":"\n重定向请求到 Pingora 代理服务，包含完整路径信息。\n\n## 工作原理\n此接口会返回 307 重定向，将请求转发到 Pingora 代理服务的实际端口和路径。\n\n## 实际代理路径\n真正的代理由 Pingora 处理，路径格式为：\n```\nGET /proxy/{port}/{path}\n```\n\n## 使用示例\n```bash\n# 访问此接口\nGET /proxy/8080/api/users\n\n# 返回 307 重定向到：\n# http://127.0.0.1:{pingora_port}/proxy/8080/api/users\n\n# Pingora 代理到：\n# 127.0.0.1:8080/api/users\n```\n","operationId":"proxy_to_port_with_path","parameters":[{"name":"port","in":"path","description":"目标端口号","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","minimum":0}},{"name":"path","in":"path","description":"目标路径","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"307":{"description":"重定向到 Pingora 代理服务","content":{"text/plain":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"503":{"description":"代理服务未启用","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProxyErrorResponse"}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"AgentStatus":{"type":"string","description":"Agent 服务状态","enum":["Active","Idle","Terminating"]},"AgentStatusResponse":{"type":"object","description":"Agent 状态查询响应","required":["project_id","is_alive"],"properties":{"created_at":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time","description":"创建时间（仅当 is_alive 为 true 时存在）","example":"2024-01-01T10:00:00Z"},"is_alive":{"type":"boolean","description":"Agent 是否存活","example":true},"last_activity":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time","descrip